---
description: React frontend conventions
globs: src/frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

- React + TypeScript + Tailwind. Server state via TanStack Query, no global store.
- All API calls go through `src/frontend/src/api.ts`.
- Every AI-originated value is visibly badged ("AI suggested") and shows its
  citation or source span. Humans must be able to override with a reason.
- Never render an Approve / Reject button to a non-committee role.
- Add `data-testid` on interactive elements used by Playwright.
